# Family conventions (LapTap ↔ LapTap Coach)

Two sibling PWAs. No shared library. When a PWA/install/wake-lock bug is fixed in LapTap, port the same patch here in the same sitting if the pattern still exists. Do not change LapTap in order to share code.

## Copy by hand from LapTap

- Black/white outdoor tokens, 3px+ borders, system-ui, large tap targets
- `touch-action: manipulation` and no text selection on controls
- Install hint + Home Screen copy (Coach wording)
- Cache-first `sw.js` with a versioned cache name and `skipWaiting`
- Screen Wake Lock while anyone is racing; reacquire on `visibilitychange`
- `Date.now()` event timestamps; interval clock is display only
- Undo history stack; reset confirm modal
- Register the service worker only when the page is not `file:`
- Canvas confetti on finish (same particle burst as LapTap)

## Keep distinct

- Storage key `laptapCoach.v1`, cache name `laptap-coach-v1`, manifest id/start_url, icons, title
- `formatTime` to hundredths (`m:ss.hh`), not LapTap’s tenths
- Layout: full-width stacked cards for 1–3 riders, 2x2 for 4; not LapTap’s sequential discipline phases
- Timing: opening segment + full laps (default 6 laps, opening 0)
- Per-rider tap debounce, not LapTap’s global 800 ms cooldown
- No screenshot helper or html2canvas
